+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+   Tech space: the whole section (heading, hint and the planets) fits in the height of the screen, the orbit lines are white, and the orbit of
+   the planet you hover (or whose pop-up is open) lights up while the other orbits go quiet. */
+@media (min-width: 901px) {
+  .ts {
+    height: 100svh;
