+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+   The logo at the top (logo-mark.tsx): the white logo with the company name at the top of the page. Once the page is scrolled the name slides into
+   the mark and fades, the logo shrinks to a small glass tile and the mark settles in it (the horizontal logo turns into the icon). And the
+   recognitions (hero-badges.tsx): one on the left and one on the right of the first screen, at the height of the logo. */
+.lm {
+  position: fixed;
+  inset-inline: 0;
+  top: 1.5rem;
+  z-index: 30;
+  display: flex;
+  justify-content: center;
+  pointer-events: none;
+}
+.lm a {
+  position: relative;
+  display: block;
+  width: 11.05rem;
+  height: 2.75rem;
